 -creez-des-liens/
DESCRIPTION:From November 30 to December 4\, territorial services (health
 \, mental health\, social services\, housing\, disability\, mobile teams
 \, etc.) are invited to open their doors for one or two 90-minute sessio
 ns. The goal? Foster mutual understanding\, encourage the exchange of pr
 actices and strengthen ties among professionals. Want to promote your se
 rvice\, showcase your activities or meet new partners? Then join the adv
 enture! Registration for host organizations is open until September 11\,
  2026. And if you can\nhttps://cbcs.be/event/babbel-no%c2%b7o%c2%b7rd-20
 26-ouvrez-vos-portes-creez-des-liens/
